  "highlight": "Helen Beveridge crossed the English Channel from England to France in 19 hours 27 minutes 20 seconds on 6 October 2013.",
  "biography": [
    "Beveridge’s English Channel swim started in the evening and finished in France the following afternoon. In 2014 she crossed from Catalina to the California mainland. The Scottish Amateur Swimming Association’s North District included that crossing in its annual open-water report.",
    "The English Channel swim on 6 October 2013 took 19 hours 27 minutes 20 seconds. The Catalina federation records 13 hours 43 minutes 7 seconds on 1 October 2014. In New York the 16 June 2015 Manhattan circuit took 9 hours 39 minutes 57 seconds."
